        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story outline                                                                                            </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stardate 87, the long held deadlock in the struggle between the Gilbey Allies and the Starrichnaya Empire has suddenly been broken by the invasion of Imperial Bombay.                                                  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must become a test pilot and take the controls of the latest fighter Stinger, developed at Planet Bombay, and deliver the test aircraft to the Planet Beefeater</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a shooting game where you can move 360 degrees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The acceleration of your aircraft takes inertia, so you are able to experience a unique sense of operation that you cannot experience elsewhere.                                                                                          Clear all the missions in order to clear the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The contents of the missions are varied, such as the destruction of enemies or patroling a designated piece of airspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The graphic are created with a nostalgic dot picture reminiscent of an 80's arcade game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique dot picture characters run around the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy characters have a variety of characteristics as well, some enemies dash headlong towards your aircraft, some enemies stay back and shoot guided missiles, and some take a lot of damage to defeat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must quickly find the right strategy appropriate for each enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use a gamepad that is supported by android.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using it, more fine control is possible.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story outline                                                                                            </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stardate 87, the long held deadlock in the struggle between the Gilbey Allies and the Starrichnaya Empire has suddenly been broken by the invasion of Imperial Bombay.                                                  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must become a test pilot and take the controls of the latest fighter Stinger, developed at Planet Bombay, and deliver the test aircraft to the Planet Beefeater</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game overview</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a shooting game where you can move 360 degrees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The acceleration of your aircraft takes inertia, so you are able to experience a unique sense of operation that you cannot experience elsewhere.                                                                                          Clear all the missions in order to clear the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The contents of the missions are varied, such as the destruction of enemies or patroling a designated piece of airspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The graphic are created with a nostalgic dot picture reminiscent of an 80's arcade game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique dot picture characters run around the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy characters have a variety of characteristics as well, some enemies dash headlong towards your aircraft, some enemies stay back and shoot guided missiles, and some take a lot of damage to defeat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must quickly find the right strategy appropriate for each enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also use a gamepad that is supported by android.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By using it, more fine control is possible.</p>",
